<title>USA: Amery, Wis., won by Bankers Bank.</title>
<headline>Amery, Wis., won by Bankers Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Bank said it won $1.610 million of Amery, Wis., general obligation promissory notes, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.7646 percent.</p>
</text>
